	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.500" end="00:00:02.600">Here are some words that begin<br />with the letter &quot;y.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.600" end="00:00:03.600">(makes &quot;y&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.600" end="00:00:05.667">Yum.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:05.667" end="00:00:07.267">Yarn.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:07.267" end="00:00:08.667">Yo-yo.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:08.667" end="00:00:10.533">Yardstick.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.533" end="00:00:12.000">Yacht.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.000" end="00:00:14.133">Yellow.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.133" end="00:00:14.933">&quot;Y.&quot;</p>
